Checkpoint. NameRef derives Clone and has an inherent to_owned. What comes back?
   view.to_owned()          -> Name    { first: "Ada" }   the inherent method
   ToOwned::to_owned(&view) -> NameRef { first: "Ada" }   the blanket impl

Only the inherent method's result outlives the text it was made from
   kept.first = "Grace", its own buffer
